This product includes code ported and adapted from Herdr UI (herdr-gpui),
https://github.com/penso/herdr-gpui, Copyright 2026 Fabien Penso, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. That covers parts of the UI behavior, Claude
usage, listening ports, tab moves, the file tree, status icons, cell colors,
theme palettes and theme parsing. It was rewritten in TypeScript and Rust for
Tauri; the files concerned say so in their comments. The theme palettes and
status indicators Herdr UI adapted from Herdr
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr, Apache-2.0) come with them.

src-tauri/src/herdr/ holds files copied from Herdr, Apache-2.0: see NOTICE.md and
LICENSE-APACHE there. src/themes/ holds theme files under the MIT License: see
NOTICE.md there.
